#: src/glade-window.c:2291
msgid ""
"OK, now that we are done with the overview, let's start with the new workflow"
msgstr ""
"Dobro, pošto smo završili sa uvodom, hajmo krenuti sa novim načinom rada"

#: src/glade-window.c:2293
